{"id":106,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","X","FireRed"],"text":"The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick."},{"games":["Sword","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"This amazing Pokémon has an awesome sense of balance. It can kick in succession from any position."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"When kicking, the sole of its foot turns as hard as a diamond on impact and destroys its enemy."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Hitmonlee’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"If it starts kicking repeatedly, both legs will stretch even longer to strike a fleeing foe."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra-long, loping strides."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its legs freely stretch and contract. Using these springlike limbs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its tired legs."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It is also called the Kick Master. It uses its elastic legs to execute every known kick."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Limber","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's limber body prevents it from being paralyzed."},{"name":"Reckless","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up moves that have recoil damage."},{"name":"Unburden","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon's held item is used or lost."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":0,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Brown","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":236,"name":"Tyrogue","condition":null,"children":[{"id":106,"name":"Hitmonlee","condition":"Lv. 20, Atk > Def","children":[]},{"id":107,"name":"Hitmonchan","condition":"Lv. 20, Atk < Def","children":[]},{"id":237,"name":"Hitmontop","condition":"Lv. 20, Atk = Def","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,280],[1,33],[1,116],[1,252],[1,270],[1,490],[4,24],[8,67],[12,203],[16,389],[21,469],[24,299],[28,364],[32,25],[36,370],[40,179],[44,136],[50,853]],"machine":[396,226,34,280,339,523,370,811,38,89,283,203,263,374,411,416,270,282,67,490,679,118,189,398,182,240,156,179,157,317,184,214,707,444,164,241,129,14,36,269,851,168,675,918,253,410],"egg":[418,68,364,136,183,229,410],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3pt5-106","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"106","artist":"Hitoshi Ariga","img":"sv3pt5/106"},{"id":"swsh1-94","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"Sword & Shield","date":"2020-02-07","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"94","artist":"Shigenori Negishi","img":"swsh1/94"},{"id":"sm9-73","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"Team Up","date":"2019-02-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"73","artist":"Tomokazu Komiya","img":"sm9/73"},{"id":"g1-47","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"Generations","date":"2016-02-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"47","artist":"Hitoshi Ariga","img":"g1/47"},{"id":"xy3-47","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"Furious Fists","date":"2014-08-13","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"47","artist":"Hitoshi Ariga","img":"xy3/47"},{"id":"col1-58","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"Call of Legends","date":"2011-02-09","rarity":"Common","number":"58","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"col1/58"},{"id":"hgss3-52","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"HS—Undaunted","date":"2010-08-18","rarity":"Common","number":"52","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"hgss3/52"},{"id":"hsp-HGSS25","name":"Hitmonlee","set":"HGSS Black Star Promos","date":"2010-02-10","rarity":"Promo","number":"HGSS25","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"hsp/HGSS25"},{"id":"dp6-100","name":"Hitmonlee","set":